      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Etowah%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A community homecoming tradition began in Etowah during the 1930s and continued for several decades.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
